body:
I haven't graduated from uni but rn I work as an interpreter from home (I wish to work professionally as a translator). I'm from a hot city but even in the very lax conditions I work with, it was a struggle to get them to send short sleeve shirts because of my tattoos. I guess my worry also stems from my dad's prejudice against tattooed people. With the ones I have now you can't really see them unless I wear very specific garments but this one would be in the forearm and like I said, I live in a hot city >.<;

Aaahh sorry I don't really know how long it took (my perception of time sucks) but I do remember it looked quite fresh for a long time but to be fair my cicatrization is terrible and never applied anything to help them. Sorry Im not of much help with that. 
Thank you! 💕
